<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<%- include('partials/head') %>
<body>
<%- include('partials/header') %>
<main id="main"><section class="hero"><div class="wrap hero-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">● YOUR PARTNER IN CYBER RESILIENCE</p><h1>Secure today.<br>Ready for<br><em>what’s next.</em></h1><p class="intro">The right technology. The expertise to make it work. Protect your people, data and business with TS Lab’s cybersecurity portfolio and hands-on support.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="/solutions">Explore our solutions ↗</a><a href="/contact">Talk to an expert →</a></div><p class="hero-note">01 / &nbsp; From choosing a solution to supporting it.<br><b>We’re with you at every step.</b></p></div><div class="visual" role="img" aria-label="Layered protection for data, endpoints, networks and access"><span class="visual-label">A CONNECTED APPROACH TO SECURITY ↗</span><div class="orbit one"></div><div class="orbit two"></div><div class="core"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 110" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M50 8 85 22v30c0 23-16 39-35 50C31 91 15 75 15 52V22Z"/><path d="m33 53 12 12 24-27"/></svg><strong>TS LAB</strong><small>SECURITY AT THE CORE</small></div><span class="node n1">▤ &nbsp; Data protection</span><span class="node n2">⌘ &nbsp; Endpoint security</span><span class="node n3">◎ &nbsp; Secure networks</span><span class="node n4">↗ &nbsp; Trusted access</span><span class="visual-bottom">● BUILT AROUND YOUR BUSINESS</span></div></div></section>
<section class="wrap proof"><div><strong>11</strong><span>Global technology<br>partners</span></div><div><strong>5</strong><span>Core security<br>domains</span></div><div><strong>End-to-end</strong><span>Consulting, deployment<br>& ongoing support</span></div><div><strong>Pan-India</strong><span>Distribution<br>& expertise</span></div></section>
<section id="solutions" class="wrap section"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">01 / SOLUTIONS THAT FIT</p><h2>Start with your challenge.<br>Find your way forward.</h2></div><p>From a single endpoint to your entire network, build a security approach around what matters to your business.</p></div><div class="solutions-grid"><% [['Protect your data','Keep sensitive information in the right hands with data loss prevention, backup and recovery.','Data protection'],['Secure every endpoint','Protect devices against evolving threats and bring your mobile workforce under control.','Endpoint & mobility'],['Connect with confidence','Secure branches and enable identity-verified access for your hybrid teams.','Network & access'],['Understand your exposure','Identify vulnerabilities and manage insider risk with greater visibility.','Risk & identity']].forEach((s,i)=>{ %><a class="solution" href="/solutions/<%= ['data-protection','endpoint-security','network-access','cyber-risk'][i] %>"><span class="number">0<%= i+1 %> <span>↗</span></span><h3><%= s[0] %></h3><p><%= s[1] %></p><b>Explore technologies →</b></a><% }); %></div></section>
<section id="portfolio" class="portfolio section"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">02 / OUR TECHNOLOGY ECOSYSTEM</p><h2>Proven technology.<br>More possibilities.</h2></div><a href="/downloads/ts-lab-portfolio.pdf" download>Download our portfolio ↓</a></div><div class="filters" role="group" aria-label="Filter partners"><% ['All partners','Data protection','Endpoint & mobility','Network & access','Risk & identity','IT operations'].forEach((f,i)=>{ %><button data-filter="<%= f %>" aria-pressed="<%= i===0 %>"><%= f %></button><% }); %></div><p id="result-count" class="sr-only" aria-live="polite">Showing 11 partners</p><div class="partner-grid"><% partners.map(partner => [partner.name, partner.category, partner.summary, partner.slug]).forEach(p=>{ %><a class="partner partner-card-link" href="/partners/<%= p[3] %>" data-category="<%= p[1] %>" aria-label="Explore <%= p[0] %>"><span class="eyebrow"><%= p[1] %></span><h3><%= p[0] %></h3><p><%= p[2] %></p></a><% }); %></div></div></section>
<section id="services" class="services section"><div class="wrap service-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">03 / MORE THAN PRODUCTS</p><h2>Expertise that stays.<br><em>From day one.</em></h2><p>Great technology needs the right implementation. We help you select, deploy and get more from your investment—with support beyond go-live.</p><a class="button" href="/contact">Build your solution with us ↗</a></div><div><% [['Solution consulting','Right-fit technology recommendations for your business.'],['Deployment support','Help with implementation and configuration.'],['Technical assistance','Work through technical challenges with our team.'],['Training & enablement','Practical knowledge for partners, administrators and users.'],['Post-sales support','Continued assistance after go-live.']].forEach((s,i)=>{ %><div class="service-row"><span>0<%= i+1 %></span><div><h3><%= s[0] %></h3><p><%= s[1] %></p></div><span>↗</span></div><% }); %></div></div></section>
<section id="about" class="wrap section about"><p class="eyebrow">04 / MEET TS LAB</p><div><h2>Global technologies.<br>A partner closer to home.</h2><p>TS Lab Pvt Ltd is a value-added national distributor and technology solutions provider serving organizations across India. We bring cybersecurity, data protection, endpoint management, network security and digital risk management together in one portfolio.</p><p>Our mission is to help organizations safeguard digital assets, improve operational resilience and grow securely.</p></div></section>
<section id="contact" class="wrap contact"><div><p class="eyebrow">LET’S SECURE YOUR NEXT STEP</p><h2>Your next challenge.<br>Our next conversation.</h2><p>Choosing a product, planning a deployment or looking for a technology partner? Let’s find the right fit.</p><a class="button dark" href="mailto:rabindra@tslab.in?subject=Cybersecurity%20solution%20enquiry">Talk to a TS Lab expert ↗</a></div><div class="contact-details"><small>CALL OUR TEAM</small><a href="tel:+919830090055">+91 98300 90055</a><a href="tel:+919874041041">+91 98740 41041</a><small>WRITE TO US</small><a href="mailto:rabindra@tslab.in">rabindra@tslab.in ↗</a><a href="mailto:schatterjee@tslab.in">schatterjee@tslab.in ↗</a></div></section></main>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
